        "TileImage": "$($repository ebd039a9-8327-436e-bbcb-738378b95430).Image",
        "Description": "Today we have a really big and chaotic mission. I have been contacted by someone who does not want to reveal his identity, but wants us to cause chaos in the bank so that it would be easier to rob later. At first you have four targets. The bank owners Fabian Mann and Mateo Perez. As mentioned, they are the bank owners and financial managers. Then you have to eliminate the two security guards and find a big computer where you can sell all the stocks, bonds and shares at a ridiculous price.",
